        "text": "Page: Michèle Mercier. Sentence: Michèle Mercier (born 1 January 1939 as Jocelyne Yvonne Renée Mercier) is a French actress.\nPage: Michèle Mercier. Sentence: Her leading men have included Marcello Mastroianni, Vittorio Gassman, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jean Gabin, Charles Aznavour, Robert Hossein, Charles Bronson, Tony Curtis and Charlton Heston.\nPage: Charles Bronson. Sentence: Charles Bronson (born Charles Dennis Buchinsky; Lithuanian: \"Karolis Dionyzas Bučinskis\" ; November 3, 1921 – August 30, 2003) was an American actor.\nPage: Women of Devil's Island. Sentence: Women of Devil's Island (Italian: \"Le prigioniere dell'isola del diavolo\" , French: \"L'île aux filles perdues\" ) is a 1962 Italian-French adventure-drama film written and directed by  Domenico Paolella  and starring Guy Madison and Michèle Mercier.",
